  "job_B15.6.11_20251003_114329": {
    "text": "\u00deis is Alfwoldes bisceopes cwyde, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00f0\u00e6t he geann \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Sandforda in to \u00feam mynstre in to\n& anes hiwscypes he geann Godrice \u00fe\u00e6rof & an sylh\u00f0e oxna.\n& he geann his hlaforde feower horsa, twa gesadelode & twa unsadelode, & feower scyldas & IIII spera\nHe is eall gearo butan \u00feam hanon he hine wolde ful gearwian his hlaforde to gerisnum gif him God u\u00f0e.\n& Ordulfe twegra boca, Hrabanum & martyrlogium.\n& \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelinge XL mancsa goldes & \u00fe\u00e6ra wildra worfa \u00e6t \u00c6scburnan lande & twegra getelda.\n& Alfwolde munuce XX mancsa goldes & anes horses & anes geteldes.\n& Byrhtm\u00e6re preoste XX mancsa goldes & anes horses.\n& his \u00ferim magon Eadwolde & \u00c6\u00feelno\u00f0e & Grimkytele hira \u00e6lcon XX mancsa goldes & hira \u00e6lcon\n& Wulfgare his m\u00e6ge twegra wahryfta & twegra setlhr\u00e6gla & \u00fereo byrnan.\n& Godrice his a\u00f0ume twegra byrnena.\n& Eadwine m\u00e6ssepreoste V mancsa goldes & his k\u00e6ppan.\n& Leofsige m\u00e6ssepreoste \u00fe\u00e6s mannes \u00fee he him \u00e6r tolet Wunstan hatte.\n& kenwolde helm & byrnan & Boian anes horses & M\u00e6lpatrike V mancsa goldes & Leofwine Polgan\nHe l\u00e6nde Tune & his geswysternon, gehealdon hi hine.\n& Eadgyfe his swyster an strichr\u00e6gl & I hrigchr\u00e6gl & I sethr\u00e6gl & \u00c6lfl\u00e6de offestran V mancsa\n& his hiredcnihton eallon V pund to gedale \u00e6lcon be \u00feam \u00fee his m\u00e6\u00f0 w\u00e6re.\n& in to Crydian tune \u00fereo \u00feeningbec m\u00e6sseboc & bletsungboc & pistelboc & an m\u00e6ssereaf.\n& on \u00e6lcon bisceophame \u00e6lcon men freot \u00fee wite\u00feeow w\u00e6re o\u00f0\u00fee he mid his feo gebohte.\n& in to Wiltune calic & disc on CXX mancsa goldes butan \u00ferim mancsa.\n& bur\u00feenon his beddreaf.\n& \u00feises is to gewitnesse, Wulfgar \u00c6lfgares sunu & Godric be Crydian & Eadwine m\u00e6ssepreost &",
